# PROJECT: SMART FOOD WASTE PREDICTION AND INTELLIGENT DONATION ALLOCATION SYSTEM USING JAVA

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, UI/UX designer, Java enterprise developer and product engineer.

Build a complete, modern, professional, responsive and interactive website for my college project:

**Smart Food Waste Prediction and Intelligent Donation Allocation System Using Java**

The application must connect hotels, restaurants, hostels, messes, bakeries, college canteens and other food providers with verified NGOs and food rescue organizations. Its purpose is to reduce food wastage by predicting surplus food, collecting provider confirmation, intelligently allocating confirmed donations to suitable NGOs and tracking the complete collection process.

Do not create just a landing page or a static dashboard. Build a complete multi-role website with functional navigation, forms, dashboards, data tables, charts, notifications, interactive workflows and role-based access.

